{"parse": {"title": "RGS-10", "pageid": 146434, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/RGS-09\" title=\"RGS-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">RGS-10</span><a href=\"/wiki/RGS-11\" title=\"RGS-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">RGS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">10</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.9D.9E.E6.AD.A3.E5.BC.8F.E5.86.A0.E5.86.9B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"非正式冠军\">非正式冠军</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 非正式冠军</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Taste of Victory</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>致<span class=\"color-value\"></span>笨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>拙<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>致<span class=\"color-value\"></span>勇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>气<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>致<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3910110</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_9_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_9_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_9_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>*一声小提琴声*</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>你真的来自宇宙吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>呵呵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对岛主探寻的目光，小提琴手好整以暇地整理了一下裙摆，回以同样好奇的眼神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我记得在希腊生活的时候，也时常有几个老人家，对着星空自言自语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>当我为家族从海上护航回来，我告诉他们：在海上，家乡是逐渐从海天交界升上来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>那一天，他们其中的一个突然欣喜若狂，连滚带爬地跑出去了……哈哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她朝恬静的天外来客举杯致意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>享受宴会吧！不管你来自哪里，你应当为取得的胜利而喜悦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的眼睛盯着领袖手中的酒杯，歪了歪头，有少许的疑惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>听不懂……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>岛主履行待客的礼仪，大方地将她十分关注的酒杯放进她的手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>不用客气——我正好也要空出手来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_9_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_9_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_9_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>诸位，有谁现在就想试一试我们的家族游戏？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>在远离家乡、漫长的航海之中总得找些乐子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>来玩“泼酒”吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她兴致勃勃，一旁的调酒师熟练地瞬间将一只盆与六只巨大的啤酒杯放在吧台上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">岛民Ⅰ：</div><div>我要玩！我准备好了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-565320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-565320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-565320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">岛民Ⅱ：</div><div>嘿……你对“泼酒”的瘾头真大，输给我的次数还不够多吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">岛民Ⅰ：</div><div>哈哈哈哈，因为太好玩了嘛～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>“泼酒”……古希腊人在酒桌上的游戏，他们将杯中的残酒和酒渣泼向盆中漂浮的小碟子，让碟子沉底者得胜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>是一个非常考验精准度和手臂力量的游戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>十四行诗，你玩过这个游戏吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>不、不是的……我只是在拼贴报道时看过，当时的报纸有“史海拾贝”的专栏……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>助手认真地解释道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>不错！十四行诗，你很了解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>但是，我们的“泼酒”会更激烈一些！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>赋予了力量的碟子可不会老老实实地漂在水上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>盆中的碟子开始高速旋转，几乎要向外溅出水花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>这样才够有趣……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>噢！我在“自由海风号”上看过客人玩这个游戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>他们曾经热情地邀请我，不过身为一名专业的乐手，我恪守自己的职责，并未参与……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>——我的意思是说，我对它很感兴趣～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>游轮的乐手闪闪发光的眼睛看着那些如同芭蕾舞者一般旋转的小碟子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嘿！加我一个！我们现在有几个人了？我、芭卡洛儿、赫多涅……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>哈哈哈哈！我的参与对你们来说可算不上公平……不过，我可以给你们示范一局！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>毕竟是我宴请你们，也应当让你们享受游戏的乐趣！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不知有谁先欢呼了一声，众人开始投身到这古老的游戏之中。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_9_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_9_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_9_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而另一边，此时此刻，纳西索斯比她人生中任何瞬间都更接近胜利——虽然是一场非正式的胜利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-315714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-315714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-315714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>呼吸声很重，她已经不自觉地咬紧了牙关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>太用力握住沙壶球，这显然不利于获胜，但她还是如此将它推了出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>嘭！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>荷米斯的最后一枚沙壶球被撞出轨道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>好吧，我输了。冠军是你的了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙紧紧抓住并不比她矮多少的球桌，激动得连牙齿都在发抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>这不算什么，只是一场赫多涅缺席了的沙壶球而已！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>对了——忒弥斯，能帮我办一场盛大的颁奖仪式吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>纳西索斯殿下，我倒是可以用柳条为您编一顶临时的桂冠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>桂冠……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>咳咳，会不会太隆重了？还是把桂冠留给明天，留给更大的胜利吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>——明天？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来人的脚步声已透露出闲适与愉悦，纳西索斯最不愿意面对的人来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>荷米斯……！你说过今晚赫多涅没有空过来的……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她咬牙切齿地向对面的信使说，只换来对方顾左右而言他的口哨声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>就现在吧。再来一局怎么样，这位冠军？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我会赠予你一份你无法拒绝的奖励，只要你确实配得上冠军之名。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅笑容满面，宁芙下意识后退了一小步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>……好、好啊！我、我才不怕你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>对……我不怕你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说出来的话总和身体反应背道而驰，像是为了说服自己，她又战战兢兢地重复了一遍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然而事实证明，越是掷地有声的承诺，越可能拥有较短的保质期。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-315715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-315715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-315715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>怎么，“冠军”？你看起来好像不太高兴啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纳西索斯紧紧攥着手中的一枚沙壶球，像抓住胜利女神远去的一片衣角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我，我只是想赢一次而已！你为什么要出现在这里，又一次毁了我获胜的希望……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>——就像你拿走神谕给我的赐福！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>纳西索斯，我只是不喜欢不正当的胜利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她漫不经心扔出了又一枚沙壶球，于是可怜的对手距离落败又近了一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>神谕的赐福？难道你真的认为，神谕会容许你做一个小偷、一个在比赛中作弊的人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>你、你说什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我说错了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>一枚让水面无条件维持平静、方便你增强原本十分有限的神秘术的成年人鱼鳞片，这难道不是作弊吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙僵在原地，脸涨得通红。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>你，你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>还有你口中的神谕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>神谕只能在仪式上获得，你不知道吗？我还以为岛上每个人都知道呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>岛上现有的137条神谕都来自仪式，你的神谕又从何而来，谁能为它证明？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>可、可我也是在向诸神祈祷之后才获得的回应！明明真的有一条为我而诞生的溪流！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>当我请求溪流为我指明走向英雄之路的方向，它也真的向岛外流去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火山岛的主人嗤笑一声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>纳西索斯，你什么时候可以从你独自一人的世界抬起头来看看，理解并接受自然的运转与你的心意无关？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>为你而生的溪流？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>最近火山频繁的异动造出了很多的小型河道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>你说的又是其中哪一条？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即便对方是岛上的君主，纳西索斯也在这一连串语言的进攻中逐渐失去了理智。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>不，不！那神谕怎么可能会不存在？我不可能……我不会一直输的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>——你的意思是说，如果没有神谕允诺你胜利，你就不会胜利？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我……我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像是为了挥开那些否定她全部存在的话语，她紧闭双眼，将手中的沙壶球用力推了出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>球像被她求胜的意志深深感染，带着一种万中无一的气势飞了出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她仅剩的这一枚独将，在连续的反弹中把赫多涅处在高分区的几枚沙壶球统统撞飞了出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后，它优雅地滑行至低分区，稳稳停下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众目睽睽之下，代表胜利的沙壶球像典礼上获勋的小兵，充满骄傲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>获得胜利的纳西索斯呆若木鸡，立在原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315723.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315723.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我……我赢了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你赢了！你赢了赫多涅！纳西索斯！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沙壶球游戏早已吸引了所有聚在酒吧的客人前来旁观。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>恭喜你，纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>纳西索斯小姐——你还好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>助手关切的手在她眼前轻轻挥舞几下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纳西索斯神情恍惚地看着众人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315723.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315723.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-315723.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315723.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我……赢了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙的颈间多了一样东西，她下意识地用手摸了摸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一份无法拒绝的奖励。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一枚鳞片被串在精美的银项链上，盈盈地发着光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315621.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-315621.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315621.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315621.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-315621.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315621.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-315621.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315621.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>今日冠军的战利品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我不关心你的神谕是真是假。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>或者，你仍旧相信，是神谕使你在我这里得到了胜利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-315610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-315610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-315610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>——但你最好想想该怎么用它，纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我，我不知道……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不敢相信的是，自己在今夜获得了胜利——虽然是在一个仅供娱乐的小游戏上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一切来得太快，她除了紧紧攥住失而复得的鳞片，什么也来不及想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……随你吧，反正我随时能拿回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火山岛的领袖朝她挥了挥手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>咦……远旅小姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不对，这些都是你喝的吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乐手小心地牵起远旅的手，身旁的吧台上摆满了空的啤酒杯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>远旅小姐，你感觉还好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>……呵呵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她仍旧神情宁静，微笑着摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>哦……再来……再来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">岛民Ⅰ：</div><div>我的酒量不会……输给……任何人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-565320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-565320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-565320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">岛民Ⅱ：</div><div>胡、胡说……你从来没赢过我……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>老天啊！你把他们都喝趴了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>船长一脸震惊地看着东倒西歪的人们。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_04\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-3_9_bg_04.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-3_9_bg_04.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-3_9_bg_04.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>散场后的赫利孔门前归于平静，两位旧识再次相遇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-653120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-653120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-653120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>纳西索斯殿下，您还好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对老朋友的亲切问候，宁芙倔强地扭过头去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-315711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-315711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-315711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>阿波罗，我现在不想和你说话！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然而只过了一会儿，她就不情不愿地把头转了回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>所以，关于神谕，之前你一直在骗我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>那您之前又是为什么如此相信它呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>预言者温和地提问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>关于赫多涅殿下说的那些，您心中从不曾有过疑惑吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我、我……我已经被搞糊涂了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的脸上浮现出失落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我只是想赢一次……但不是这样小的胜利……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>唉。纳西索斯殿下，虽然我不是忒弥斯那样的执法者，但也不会骗人啊。尤其不会欺骗自己的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>你……你是说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙的眼睛一点点亮了起来，声音不自觉地提高。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>所以神谕还是真的？就算不是现在，在明天，我的英雄也会在运动会上正式打败赫多涅！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>纳西索斯，我的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>我告诉过您，神谕是一种启示：它指向一条道路、一个警示，或者仅仅是某种可能性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>但它并不是命令或者馈赠。所以，我们无须对它抱有超过生活本身的热忱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我没听懂……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在纳西索斯疑惑的目光中，预言者和以往一样耸了耸肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>没关系，神谕之所以存在仅仅是因为众神使它存在，而不是为了让任何人听懂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>未来的某一天，我们总会明白它意味着什么。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "RGS-10"}}